    kind: work_item  # 7c82
    title: "js-module-linker reads repo-relative Symbol.path as absolute: relative imports resolve against the process CWD (koel: -29% module_exports from outside the repo) and tsconfig path aliases never resolve (mint a phantom npm package)"  # 7c82
    status: todo_hard  # 7c82
    priority: 2  # 7c82
    parent:  # 7c82
    tags:  # 7c82
    - linker  # 7c82
