  message: "PRIORITY CONFIRMED P2 2026-09-25 (agent's call, delegated by the owner). Half (a) makes JS/TS module-linker output depend on the process CWD, and bakeoffs run from outside the analyzed repo. Every bakeoff measurement of JS imports / module_exports is therefore taken in the degraded mode (koel: imports 4,078 -> 3,680, module_exports 2,085 -> 1,471). That contaminates the instrument the project steers by, which is P2 by the queue's own standard."  # a7e8
